  "captions": [
    {
      "start": 0.42,
      "end": 3.05,
      "text": "Ever gotten a message that just says,"
    },
    {
      "start": 3.07,
      "end": 4.45,
      "text": "can we talk tomorrow?"
    },
    {
      "start": 4.47,
      "end": 7.3,
      "text": "And suddenly your brain starts preparing for a disaster"
    },
    {
      "start": 7.43,
      "end": 9.24,
      "text": "that hasn't even happened yet?"
    },
    {
      "start": 9.52,
      "end": 10.65,
      "text": "Here's the thing."
    },
    {
      "start": 10.67,
      "end": 13.35,
      "text": "Anxiety is your brain's alarm system."
    },
    {
      "start": 13.37,
      "end": 15.34,
      "text": "Its whole job is to protect you."
    },
    {
      "start": 15.7,
      "end": 18.49,
      "text": "Sometimes it just treats an ordinary moment like a five"
    },
    {
      "start": 18.61,
      "end": 19.92,
      "text": "alarm emergency."
    },
    {
      "start": 20.28,
      "end": 22.19,
      "text": "Your brain isn't your enemy."
    },
    {
      "start": 22.25,
      "end": 25.27,
      "text": "It's just being a little too protective."
    },
    {
      "start": 25.29,
      "end": 27.13,
      "text": "So what does that look like?"
    },
    {
      "start": 27.17,
      "end": 30.57,
      "text": "Replaying a conversation from three years ago."
    },
    {
      "start": 30.817,
      "end": 32.53,
      "text": "A racing heart and sweaty hands."
    },
    {
      "start": 32.82,
      "end": 34.39,
      "text": "Avoiding that one email."
    },
    {
      "start": 34.41,
      "end": 38.0,
      "text": "Or a tiny problem growing into a giant monster in your"
    },
    {
      "start": 38.02,
      "end": 39.29,
      "text": "imagination."
    },
    {
      "start": 39.56,
      "end": 41.91,
      "text": "Which one sounds most familiar?"
    },
    {
      "start": 42.22,
      "end": 43.03,
      "text": "Take a second."
    },
    {
      "start": 43.05,
      "end": 43.85,
      "text": "Really."
    },
    {
      "start": 44.12,
      "end": 45.37,
      "text": "And when it shows up,"
    },
    {
      "start": 45.46,
      "end": 46.49,
      "text": "you've got options."
    },
    {
      "start": 46.88,
      "end": 47.53,
      "text": "First, name it."
    },
    {
      "start": 47.61,
      "end": 49.27,
      "text": "I'm feeling anxious right now."
    },
    {
      "start": 49.41,
      "end": 52.48,
      "text": "A feeling is not automatically a fact."
    },
    {
      "start": 52.76,
      "end": 54.14,
      "text": "Next, ground yourself."
    },
    {
      "start": 54.16,
      "end": 56.53,
      "text": "Name five things you can see."
    },
    {
      "start": 56.8,
      "end": 57.66,
      "text": "Four you can touch."
    },
    {
      "start": 57.72,
      "end": 58.99,
      "text": "Three you can hear."
    },
    {
      "start": 59.01,
      "end": 61.45,
      "text": "It pulls you right back into the present."
    },
    {
      "start": 61.72,
      "end": 62.54,
      "text": "And finally,"
    },
    {
      "start": 62.56,
      "end": 63.59,
      "text": "slow down."
    },
    {
      "start": 63.61,
      "end": 65.07,
      "text": "One gentle breath."
    },
    {
      "start": 65.09,
      "end": 69.01,
      "text": "You don't have to solve every problem in your head today."
    },
    {
      "start": 69.28,
      "end": 69.72,
      "text": "Remember,"
    },
    {
      "start": 69.75,
      "end": 71.92,
      "text": "your brain is trying to protect you."
    },
    {
      "start": 71.94,
      "end": 75.35,
      "text": "You just don't have to believe every scary story it tells"
    },
    {
      "start": 75.46,
      "end": 75.95,
      "text": "you."
    },
    {
      "start": 75.97,
      "end": 79.35,
      "text": "And if anxiety starts running your everyday life,"
    },
    {
      "start": 79.72,
      "end": 81.76,
      "text": "talking to a professional is a strong move,"
    },
    {
      "start": 81.81,
      "end": 82.75,
      "text": "not a weakness."
    },
    {
      "start": 82.77,
      "end": 83.57,
      "text": "Now tell me,"
    },
    {
      "start": 83.61,
      "end": 86.13,
      "text": "what's your brain's favorite way of overthinking?"
    },
    {
      "start": 86.15,
      "end": 88.18,
      "text": "Drop your answer in the comments."
    }
  ],
